MIT License

lemo-plus: an add-on skill for Lemo-Opuscar.

Portions of this skill (the writing method, the camera vocabulary, the typography rules, the look board method,
scripts/spark.py, scripts/words_check.py, scripts/type_deal.py, scripts/palette.py, assets/cam.js, and the data files
data/sparks.json, data/seeds.json and data/type-library.json) are adapted from cinecode
(https://github.com/sarpstar/cinecode, commit 67f9807112b97ae253d4a5f0eccaccc46c3b2633):

Copyright (c) 2026 Sarp Yıldız (@sarpstar)

data/seeds.json holds UNESCO World Heritage and Intangible Cultural Heritage names from Wikidata (CC0).
Fonts listed in data/type-library.json keep their own licences (mostly SIL OFL 1.1); no font file is included.

